  "description": "Why Choose Actbest Striker Plus ?\nThe Striker Plus is the ultimate all-terrain electric bike engineered for riders who refuse to compromise on power or performance. At its heart lies a massive 2000W peak motor paired with a high-capacity 52V 20Ah battery, delivering an incredible 90-mile max range(PAS) to conquer even the longest journeys without range anxiety.\nDesigned to dominate everything from city pavement to rugged backroads, this fat tire electric bike features 20*4\" fat tires and a premium full suspension system. We’ve equipped it with a high-performance hydraulic suspension front fork and dual rear shock absorbers to ensure a buttery-smooth ride, even on the most demanding trails.\nSafety and control are paramount for the American rider, which is why the Striker Plus comes standard with precision hydraulic brakes for instant stopping power and a 7-speed gear shift system for effortless climbing. Whether you're looking for a high-performance moped or a heavy-duty partner for your next off-road adventure, the Striker Plus provides the stability, speed, and comfort needed to own the road.",
